/// - **#ASSUME_GENERATION_COUNTER**: 64-bit generation prevents stale reads (verified: modulo math)
/// - **#ASSUME_LOCKFREE_ONLY**: All updates via atomic, no mutex/RwLock (verified: grep)
/// - **#ASSUME_CACHE_ALIGNED**: #[repr(C, align(512))] prevents false sharing (verified: compile-time)
